      <img src="/assets/images/blog/how-much-to-retire-at-50-decade-plan.jpg" alt="A decade-by-decade retirement build plan: what to do in your 30s and 40s to retire at 50 in India" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:var(--radius-md);">
